{"3544610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "A Sea of Grey & Green", "steam_appid": 3544610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the mysterious &quot;Cas&quot; on what could become their last day alive, as they obsess over the daily routine that's slowly breaking them down. A Sea of Grey &amp; Green emphasises character and mood over gameplay. Step into Cas’s shoes for a day, let’s find out if you can live to see another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 1st person exploration game is dark, strange and sadistic. Deride over your kingdom of grey &amp; green. Try to drag yourself through to the evening in this “day-in-the-life simulator”. Unfortunately for you, this person’s life is… complicated to say the least. Good luck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as the mysterious &quot;Cas&quot; on what could become their last day alive, as they obsess over the daily routine that's slowly breaking them down. A Sea of Grey &amp; Green emphasises character and mood over gameplay. Step into Cas’s shoes for a day, let’s find out if you can live to see another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This 1st person exploration game is dark, strange and sadistic. Deride over your kingdom of grey &amp; green. Try to drag yourself through to the evening in this “day-in-the-life simulator”. Unfortunately for you, this person’s life is… complicated to say the least. Good luck.</p>", "short_description": "A Sea of Grey &amp; Green is a First Person exploration game. Explore your surroundings, find hidden objects, complete Cas' daily tasks and uncover what it really means to see life through their macabre eyes.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3544610/60ee84d9d8a20faae7f92a5aa0c936f9662121df/header.jpg?t=1786734031", "capsule_image":